<title>USA: MBIA acquires MuniFinancial.</title>
<headline>MBIA acquires MuniFinancial.</headline>
<dateline>ARMONK, N.Y. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Inc said Thursday that it has acquired MuniFinancial, the country's largest public finance consulting firm specializing in municipal debt administration.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MuniFinancial, based in Temecula, Calif., provides a full range of services to municipalities, including administration of assessment and community-facilities districts, arbitrage rebate calculation, delinquency management and municipal disclosure.</p>
<p>The company has about 250 municipal clients and maintains client service offices in Chicago, Seattle, San Francisco, Sacramento, Washington, D.C., and Boca Raton.</p>
</text>
